# Converted JK2 assets — models, saber hilts and blade textures. All
# Raven/Activision material, and this repo is public with permanent history, so
# none of it can be committed; it's served from the private Supabase bucket
# instead. See docs/jk2-model-conversion.md and public/models/README.md. The
# CC0/CC-BY Khronos sample model IS committed, deliberately, as a known-good
# asset to test against.
